OL,3,GNEWSAFourth council opposes #5bn CO2
OL,4,Apipeline plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCheshire East Council has become the
OL,7,Ffourth local authority to formally
OL,8,Foppose the proposed Peak Cluster carbon
OL,9,Fdioxide pipeline.
OL,11,FCouncillors unanimously backed a motion
OL,12,Fcalling on the government not to
OL,13,Fapprove the scheme until concerns over
OL,14,Fsafety, environmental impacts and
OL,15,Feffects on local communities are
OL,16,Faddressed.
OL,18,FThe #5bn project would transport carbon
OL,19,Fdioxide captured at cement and lime
OL,20,Fplants in Derbyshire and Staffordshire
OL,21,Fto storage sites beneath the Irish Sea.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
