OL,3,GNEWSAFourth council opposes #5bn CO2
OL,4,Apipeline plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters say it could cut emissions
OL,7,Ffrom hard-to-decarbonise industries and
OL,8,Fprotect jobs, while opponents have
OL,9,Fraised concerns about safety,
OL,10,Fenvironmental damage and disruption
OL,11,Fduring construction.
